    "body": ">> If data is [empty](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty), [append](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-append) message to data.\r\n>\r\n> would be more clearly expressed as\r\n>\r\n>>If data is [empty](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty), let data be message.\r\n\r\nThe variable _data_ cannot be re-declared here via \"let\", since it already exists.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nThe second comment you make seems fine, though I'm not sure it is worth the change. If you want to upload a PR for it, feel free. But I don't think we need an issue to track this.",
